  "topic": "古币镜",
  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "doc-6998af41d413178e21b306",
      "section": "前期运营及应变",
      "text": "单挂弈星，先将棋手升到3级，再开始刷新商店，找到芈月、镜并优先觉醒，西施、盾山、程咬金各买一张即可。第1次拍卖：镜 > 芈月 > 程咬金。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-6b2a5427204395ecd13b41e1ab2bf4c137a9f8ebe86e50cdb49f460a0dfc4aa7",
          "paragraph_start": 17,
          "paragraph_end": 17
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-42a2f24de2b8a5a56ad130",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "婉儿、盾山的作用是提供古币，觉醒之后也不会提供更多的古币，所以没必要觉醒；程咬金作为主坦，后期可以考虑觉醒，前期资源优先用于觉醒芈月、镜。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-6b2a5427204395ecd13b41e1ab2bf4c137a9f8ebe86e50cdb49f460a0dfc4aa7",
          "paragraph_start": 4,
          "paragraph_end": 4
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-8b99f1a80bc8d5dc997151",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "留一个打出位，用来上庄周，蒙犽，露娜这些英雄。打露娜的登场可以触发婉儿，程咬金的整备，获得古币，提升镜的等级。蒙犽的特训战术可帮我们快速升级，庄周的招募战术则是帮我们构建阵容。后期也可以用来上太乙真人给复活，或钟馗减对面等级。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-6b2a5427204395ecd13b41e1ab2bf4c137a9f8ebe86e50cdb49f460a0dfc4aa7",
          "paragraph_start": 5,
          "paragraph_end": 5
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-7a3709046311ca50fdf922",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "前中期镜的蓝量无法降到10点，可以在商店购买临阵磨枪/全军动员，触发西施的整备效果给镜减蓝量。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-6b2a5427204395ecd13b41e1ab2bf4c137a9f8ebe86e50cdb49f460a0dfc4aa7",
          "paragraph_start": 6,
          "paragraph_end": 6
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-b81a38ab659a0b2c1ab6ee",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "梦奇可以作为打出位，上阵梦奇以及出售后开出的英雄兑换券均可以触发姜导的钦定主角提升等级，英雄兑换券还能同步触发芈月词条。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-6b2a5427204395ecd13b41e1ab2bf4c137a9f8ebe86e50cdb49f460a0dfc4aa7",
          "paragraph_start": 9,
          "paragraph_end": 9
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-39e07c0413ab704fee2c0e",
      "section": "中期运营及应变",
      "text": "镜来以后对镜使用姜导的技能，所有装备都给镜，构建好阵容就可以慢慢提升镜的等级，镜等级高能稳血就考虑上棋手4阶找上官婉儿，上官婉儿有1张即可。第2次拍卖：上官婉儿 > 太乙真人。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-6b2a5427204395ecd13b41e1ab2bf4c137a9f8ebe86e50cdb49f460a0dfc4aa7",
          "paragraph_start": 19,
          "paragraph_end": 19
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-def8612283f08a2d399730",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "没有青莲剑谱的镜后期输出较为乏力，可以存遗志传承转成海月，配合钟馗、瑶、太乙、扁鹊，提高阵容后期上限。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-6b2a5427204395ecd13b41e1ab2bf4c137a9f8ebe86e50cdb49f460a0dfc4aa7",
          "paragraph_start": 7,
          "paragraph_end": 7
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-c3c6da927ac22c853933c7",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "后期镜/芈月未觉醒可以用杨玉环觉醒，上阵后立刻卖出腾出位置。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-6b2a5427204395ecd13b41e1ab2bf4c137a9f8ebe86e50cdb49f460a0dfc4aa7",
          "paragraph_start": 8,
          "paragraph_end": 8
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-976324e426f6d63f34ed83",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "后期装备溢出可以购买武装分解寻找特殊装备，开出青莲剑谱可以提升镜的上限。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-6b2a5427204395ecd13b41e1ab2bf4c137a9f8ebe86e50cdb49f460a0dfc4aa7",
          "paragraph_start": 10,
          "paragraph_end": 10
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-2955a784d3ec4158da2a7d",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "后期战力高了之后考虑存钱提升棋手等阶，这套阵容需要上棋手6阶，给镜提供吸血和免控。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-6b2a5427204395ecd13b41e1ab2bf4c137a9f8ebe86e50cdb49f460a0dfc4aa7",
          "paragraph_start": 21,
          "paragraph_end": 21
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-89be61ec446122c2d2c7d9",
      "section": "推荐装备",
      "text": "镜装备推荐：无尽、凝渊、炽热，特殊装备推荐青莲剑谱，配合镜的低蓝量可以频繁释放技能，有青莲剑谱的镜100级后释放技能无法选中；姜导六级专属天赋可以给镜免控，不用选免控装备，可以选纯净苍穹清除负面效果，如减速；镜100级后技能有回血加上姜导的双吸，本身不缺续航，吸血装备也不用准备。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-6b2a5427204395ecd13b41e1ab2bf4c137a9f8ebe86e50cdb49f460a0dfc4aa7",
          "paragraph_start": 12,
          "paragraph_end": 12
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-d76c8bbad0028f972cbc55",
      "section": "推荐天赋及原因",
      "text": "天赋：可以选逐鹿和河洛的天赋，河洛的天赋要适配，不适配的不要选。不知道选什么天赋也可以选给装备，给减伤，免伤的天赋。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-6b2a5427204395ecd13b41e1ab2bf4c137a9f8ebe86e50cdb49f460a0dfc4aa7",
          "paragraph_start": 13,
          "paragraph_end": 13
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-d3450de8eed34363c935bc",
      "section": "关键效果牌",
      "text": "效果牌：可以拿古币，唤醒，临阵磨枪等。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": false,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "type": "document",
          "source": "doc-6b2a5427204395ecd13b41e1ab2bf4c137a9f8ebe86e50cdb49f460a0dfc4aa7",
          "paragraph_start": 14,
          "paragraph_end": 14
        }
      ],
      "origin": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "doc-7929072f856e9052c65d4f",
      "section": "后期运营及应变",
      "text": "材料已给出的棋手升级操作按前、中、后期执行；未明确各中间等阶的独立找牌目标、停留边界或六阶后资源安排时，仍待确认。升级前同时比较当前战力、掉血风险、核心与觉醒进度，以及升级后买牌预算；不能仅因到达某回合就忽略保命战力。",
      "version": null,
      "condition": "",
      "inference": true,
      "kind": "conditional_strategy",
      "evidence": [
